<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth T-bill yield drops to 21.46 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth T-bill yield drops to 21.46 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auctign at 21.46 percent on Wednesday, down from 21.63 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Tgtal on offer	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     7,294.70 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.46 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.9214 pct</p>
</text>
